        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Attack on Titan closely follows the riveting story line of Attack on Titan’s first season and focuses on the exploits of various key characters, putting the player in a position to relive the anime’s most shocking, courageous, and exhilarating moments. It revolves around the story of three young people who survive the destruction of their walled city district by enormous, man-eating Titans and eventually go on to join the Scout Regiment in order to protect humanity from this overpowering foe.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Attack on Titan sigue de cerca la apasionante trama de la primera temporada del anime y se centra en las hazañas de diversos personajes clave, colocando al jugador en la posición de revivir los momentos más impactantes, valientes y emocionantes del anime. Gira en torno a la historia de tres jóvenes que sobreviven a la destrucción de su distrito amurallado a manos de enormes Titanes devoradores de hombres y que, finalmente, se unen al Cuerpo de Exploración para proteger a la humanidad de este enemigo abrumador.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2016",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
